  },
  "ingredients": [
    "1/3 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1/3 cup butter (softened)",
    "3 large egg (room temp)",
    "1/4 cup heavy cream",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "sea salt (to taste)",
    "1/4 cup brewed coffee (strong)",
    "2 large egg yolk (room temp)",
    "2 tablespoon powdered stevia/erythritol blend",
    "4 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon sour cream",
    "1/2 cup heavy cream (chilled)",
    "1/4 teaspoon cocoa powder (for dusting)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and prep them. Pre-heat oven to 350F. Line a square baking dish with parchment paper and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "For the cake, beat together the butter and sweetener in a bowl until light in color and slightly fluffy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the eggs, heavy cream, and vanilla extract and beat to incorporate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the almond flour, baking powder, and salt and beat again until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the batter to the square baking dish and use a spatula to smooth out the top. Bake for 20-25 minutes until golden brown or an inserted toothpick comes out clean.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the cake is cooking, start on the filling. Beat the egg yolks and powdered sweetener in a metal bowl, then place over a pan to create a double-boiler.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the pan on to boil the water and once boiling, reduce heat to low. Cook the egg yolk mixture for 4-5 minutes while continuously stirring until the mixture is lighter in color and slightly frothy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-21.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the mixture off of the heat and beat the mixture again until thicker, darker in color, and glossy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-22.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, beat the heavy cream until whipped with stiff peaks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-25.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cream cheese and sour cream to the beaten egg yolk mixture, then beat slowly to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-26.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold the cream cheese mixture into the whipped cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-29.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the cake is cooled, remove from the baking dish and put it onto a cutting board.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour strong coffee slowly over the top of the cake until evenly distributed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-31.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the cake in half, forming 2 large rectangles.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-33.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice one half of the cake with the filling mixture, then place the second piece of the cake on top of that and ice again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-14",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Low-carb-keto-tiramisu-35.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dust with cocoa powder and slice to serve. Enjoy as a decadent dessert or rich breakfast!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-tiramisu/#wprm-recipe-53433-step-0-15",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
